  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "Hint : Elevation in boiling point $\\propto$ No. of solute particles\n$\\mathrm{KNO}_3$ (strong electrolyte); $\\mathrm{KNO}_{3(\\text { (aq) }} \\rightarrow \\mathrm{K}_{(\\mathrm{aq})}^{+}+\\mathrm{NO}_{3 \\text { (aq) }}^{-}$\nNaCl (Strong electrolyte); $\\mathrm{NaCl}_{(\\mathrm{aq})} \\rightarrow \\mathrm{Na}_{\\text {(aq) }}^{+}+\\mathrm{Cl}_{\\text {(aq) }}$\n$\\mathrm{CH}_3 \\mathrm{COOH}$ (Weak electrolyte); $\\mathrm{CH}_3 \\mathrm{COOH}_{(\\mathrm{aq})} \\rightleftharpoons \\mathrm{CH}_3 \\mathrm{COO}_{(\\text {aq) }}+\\mathrm{H}_{\\text {(aq) }}^{+}$\nSucrose (Non-electrolyte)",
